      "title_kr": "장소",
      "body": "Korean place vocabulary is essential for navigating cities, giving and receiving directions, and daily life. Korea has excellent public transportation — knowing 지하철역 (subway station), 버스정류장 (bus stop), and 공항 (airport) will take you far.",
      "tip": { "icon": "🏙️", "label": "Asking for directions", "text": "The most useful phrase: 어디예요? (Where is it?) or 어떻게 가요? (How do I get there?). Combine with place names: 지하철역이 어디예요? (Where is the subway station?)" }
